---
layout: "base.webc"
title: "2019 May"
id: "201905"
poemTitle: "Colourful May"
author: "Eila Webster"
endOfYear: false
---

<div class="full-width">
  <poem-grid
    class="wide-text"
    :title="poemTitle"
    :author="author"
    :theme="bgTheme"
  >
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-7.avif" alt="" slot="header-tl" />
    <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-8.avif" alt="" slot="header-tr" />

    <!-- Column 1 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-1-images">
      <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-0.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-2.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-3.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <!-- Column 2 Text -->
    <div slot="col-2-text">
      <p>
        May is the month of blossom, <br />
        You find it everywhere; <br />
        On shrubs on trees and gardens, <br />
        Proclaiming spring is in the air.
      </p>

      <p>
        Daylight hours are warmer, <br />
        With sunlight shining bright; <br />
        Early in the morning now, <br />
        To fill hearts with delight.
      </p>

      <p>
        Roll up your sleeves – get busy, <br />
        Now there is lots to do; <br />
        Growing fruit and vegetables, <br />
        To last the whole year through.
      </p>

      <p>
        The lawn just keeps on growing, <br />
        And weeds – they never fade ; <br />
        It’s time for the garden tools, <br />
        So out comes the hoe and spade .
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 3 Middle Images -->
    <div slot="col-3-images">
      <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-10.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-1.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-9.avif" alt="" />
    </div>

    <!-- Column 4 Text -->
    <div slot="col-4-text">
      <p>
        Preparing the ground for planting , <br />
        Potatoes, beans and peas; <br />
        There’s no time here this month, <br />
        To take things at your ease.
      </p>

      <p>
        But hard work now is worth it, <br />
        When you have your winter store; <br />
        All fresh and home grown, <br />
        Now who could wish for more.
      </p>

      <p>
        So do your very best this month, <br />
        And carry on with a smile; <br />
        Enjoying your home-grown harvest, <br />
        Makes everything worthwhile.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Column 5 Images (15%) -->
    <div slot="col-5-images">
      <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-4.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-6.avif" alt="" />
      <img src="/poems/2019-may/image-5.avif" alt="" />
    </div>
  </poem-grid>
</div>
